## Why This Is Asked
This question assesses understanding of insider threat mitigation and cryptographic key management at scale in multi-tenant environments.

## Key Concepts
- Envelope encryption for efficient large-scale data protection
- Per-tenant Data Encryption Keys (DEKs) for tenant isolation
- Regional HSM/KMS master keys for regulatory compliance
- Automatic key rotation without service interruption
- Tamper-evident audit trails for compliance
- Incident response procedures for cryptographic incidents

